2. Obscura — browser engine (Apache License 2.0)
=========================================================================

IraLens uses the Obscura headless browser engine
(https://github.com/h4ckf0r0day/obscura, Apache License 2.0, Copyright its
respective authors) as its internal browser engine.

No Obscura source code is copied into this repository. The engine is a
prebuilt binary that `iralens install-engine` downloads at runtime
directly from the upstream project's official GitHub releases; IraLens
does not mirror, bundle, or redistribute the binary. The upstream project
ships no NOTICE file, so no additional upstream notices are due. If you
choose to redistribute the engine binary yourself, you must do so under the
terms of its Apache License 2.0 (including its own third-party notices as
published upstream).
